    "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:31:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:31:36Z",
    "body": "We hit this in Servo as well and had to land two fixes: https://github.com/servo/servo/pull/49427 and https://github.com/servo/servo/pull/49518\n\nThe two places we fixed:\n* https://github.com/servo/servo/blob/3e2b4ac8bd837eae5251fe9cd6cdd32648c10cce/components/script/dom/document/document.rs#L3081-L3083 which maps to https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-lifecycle.html#abort-a-document after step 4 in an otherwise branch\n* https://github.com/yezhizhen/servo/blob/72804fc9a2619499af117b98af1bcb807142d2ea/components/script/dom/document/document.rs#L2563-L2572 which maps to https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#the-end after step 9.1 for an additional check if the document hasn't aborted yet\n\nFor the latter we added a test to confirm all browsers work like this: https://wpt.fyi/results/html/browsers/browsing-the-web/navigating-across-documents/window-stop-in-image-load-handler.html (pending merge of https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/64531 at the time of writing this comment)",
